d your family. Because remember, can't live with an empty belly!\n\nFind the right VHS scattered around the house through a randomic system of placement in order to find the code to escape the house.\nGood Luck!\n\nThe Cooking Class is an horror escape room, there are no hints, no clues, you are completely alone.\nOr, are you?\n\nThe first of a scheduled trilogy of games involving the Dupont Family, The Cooking Class is an homage to VHS found footage horror, 80's and 90's slasher movies, and the story of a family and its legacy.\n\nA first person atmospheric game, where the player will have to find its way out.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-cooking-class", "videos": [{"id": 80699, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "E4DO3AHexIY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E4DO3AHexIY", "title": "Trailer for \"The Cooking Class\"", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/E4DO3AHexIY/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}